    "body": "`GetTotalBumpFees()` in `spend.cpp` calculates the fee a transaction needs. The mutant adds the group discount instead of subtracting it, making the wallet pay more than necessary.\n\nThe existing test checks the waste score but doesn't verify the actual fee. I added a check that catches this error: with the mutant, it fails with `90 != 30`.\n\nRelated: #36614",
